name: Glass Joker — glass-destroy X-mult
author: corpus
description: >-
  Glass Joker gains X0.75 Mult for every Glass card destroyed. First-shop scaling X-mult:
  create and destroy Glass cards repeatedly (Aura, Magician, The Tower) to stack it.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: GlassJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: Seltzer
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: Showman
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
  - joker: MarbleJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 20
